#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:17
#: 6d7264577a08422a913598a60b5aaf3f
msgid ""
"Install through **fa-py-libraries** (Python 3.12 env). That repo’s "
"`./init.sh all` installs `ros2_robot_interface` among the other submodules."
msgstr ""
"通过 **fa-py-libraries** 安装（Python 3.12 环境）。该仓库的 `./init.sh all` 会安装 "
"`ros2_robot_interface` 以及其他子模块。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:19
#: 96d9ea1634a445859ff5d3d6f9631149
msgid ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all"
msgstr ""
"git clone https://github.com/fiveages-sim/fa-py-libraries.git\n"
"cd fa-py-libraries\n"
"./init.sh all"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:25
#: 03a6a3c72e69404e8cbc958779781951
msgid ""
"Datagen / motion-queue path: from a **lerobot_ros2** checkout, `./init.sh "
"all-motion` (or `./init.sh all`) installs the same package as "
"`submodules/ros2_robot_interface`."
msgstr ""
"数据生成 / 运动队列路径：在 **lerobot_ros2** 检出中，`./init.sh all-motion`（或 `./init.sh "
"all`）会把同一包装成 `submodules/ros2_robot_interface`。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:27
#: caddff01f2d74ca893eb6a9573b88b11
