msgstr "手动回退"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:30
#: 347bbce7e70c4c26b7b8913c135f3b9b
msgid ""
"Standalone clone of `ros2_robot_interface` and `pip install -e .` (inside a "
"project venv; `--no-deps` on uv so `rclpy` is not fetched from PyPI) is only"
" for package development outside those umbrellas. Do not treat `pip install "
"ros2-robot-interface` on system Python as the stack entry."
msgstr ""
"单独克隆 `ros2_robot_interface` 并 `pip install -e .`（在项目虚拟环境内；uv 加 `--no-deps` "
"以免从 PyPI 拉 `rclpy`）只用于这些伞仓之外的包开发。不要把系统 Python 上的 `pip install ros2-robot-"
"interface` 当作本栈入口。"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:33
#: 2f8c4c933aa848f396924e90746d4e5b
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr "快速开始"

#: ../../source/4-reference/python_apps/1-ros2_robot_interface.md:35
#: 6732e1aae1254a56a0c4940e3104a324
msgid ""
"from ros2_robot_interface import RobotInterface\n"
"\n"
"robot = RobotInterface()\n"
"robot.connect()\n"
"\n"
"# Move joints\n"
"robot.move_j([0.0, -0.5, 0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 0.0])\n"
"\n"
"# Move Cartesian\n"
"robot.move_l([0.3, 0.0, 0.4], [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0])\n"
"\n"
"# Gripper\n"
"robot.gripper_open()\n"
"robot.gripper_close()\n"
msgstr ""
"from ros2_robot_interface import RobotInterface\n"
"\n"
"robot = RobotInterface()\n"
"robot.connect()\n"
"\n"
"# Move joints\n"
"robot.move_j([0.0, -0.5, 0.5, 0.0, 0.5, 0.0])\n"
"\n"
"# Move Cartesian\n"
"robot.move_l([0.3, 0.0, 0.4], [1.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0])\n"
"\n"
"# Gripper\n"
"robot.gripper_open()\n"
"robot.gripper_close()\n"

